    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d429">

                <pb facs="0451" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.77/136</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé Scholle </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-31T13:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 31, 1916, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Request that Government of Haiti instruct Ménos to present immediately Haitian
                    Government’s statement in regard to National Railway Company, so that
                    conferences may be held next week. Now that gendarmerie protocol is signed
                    Department considers it advisable to bring to completion as soon as possible all
                    outstanding questions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
